{"version":1,"bank":"B","note":"Retake banks (bank B) for \"Retake this part\" in the Your types hub. Different questions from the main quiz and the sharpen set (bank A). For fun, not official tests.","systems":{"four":"4-letter type","ennea":"Enneagram-style","temper":"Temperament","arche":"Archetype","disc":"DISC-style","attach":"Attachment","cognitive":"Decision style","learning":"Learning style","cluster":"Cluster + Big Five"},"alias":{"socionics":"four","sloan":"cluster"},"questions":[{"id":"rfo1","sys":"four","text":"A free Saturday with nothing planned. You'd text…","options":[{"t":"Five people to see who's around","v":{"E":2}},{"t":"Your one best friend","v":{"E":-1}},{"t":"Nobody. Finally, alone time","v":{"E":-2}},{"t":"Whoever, I'm fine either way","v":{"E":0}}]},{"id":"rfo2","sys":"four","text":"In a group chat that's blowing up, you're usually…","options":[{"t":"Starting half the conversations","v":{"E":2}},{"t":"Reacting and joking along","v":{"E":1}},{"t":"Reading, rarely typing","v":{"E":-1}},{"t":"Muted it hours ago","v":{"E":-2}}]},{"id":"rfo3","sys":"four","text":"You'd rather talk about…","options":[{"t":"What could happen in 50 years","v":{"O":2}},{"t":"A theory about how something works","v":{"O":2}},{"t":"What happened today","v":{"O":-1}},{"t":"How to fix a real problem right now","v":{"O":-2}}]},{"id":"rfo4","sys":"four","text":"Instructions for building something. You…","options":[{"t":"Follow them step by step","v":{"O":-2,"C":1}},{"t":"Skim, then figure it out","v":{"O":1}},{"t":"Ignore them and improvise","v":{"O":2,"C":-1}},{"t":"Look up a video of someone doing it","v":{"O":-1}}]},{"id":"rfo5","sys":"four","text":"A friend made a decision you think is a mistake. You…","options":[{"t":"Tell them straight, with reasons","v":{"A":-2}},{"t":"Point out the logic gently","v":{"A":-1}},{"t":"Ask how they feel about it first","v":{"A":1}},{"t":"Back them up, it's their call","v":{"A":2}}]},{"id":"rfo6","sys":"four","text":"When you judge whether something is fair, you go by…","options":[{"t":"The rules and the facts","v":{"A":-2}},{"t":"What makes the most sense","v":{"A":-1}},{"t":"Who gets hurt","v":{"A":2}},{"t":"A mix, depends who it is","v":{"A":1}}]},{"id":"rfo7","sys":"four","text":"Your homework/notes system is…","options":[{"t":"A planner, actually used","v":{"C":2}},{"t":"A rough list in my head","v":{"C":-1}},{"t":"Whatever's due tomorrow","v":{"C":-2}},{"t":"Reminders on my phone","v":{"C":1}}]},{"id":"rfo8","sys":"four","text":"Plans change last minute. You feel…","options":[{"t":"Annoyed, I had it all set","v":{"C":2}},{"t":"Fine, a little thrown off","v":{"C":1}},{"t":"Kind of excited","v":{"C":-1}},{"t":"I never really had plans","v":{"C":-2}}]},{"id":"rfo9","sys":"four","text":"People notice that you…","options":[{"t":"Ask 'why?' about everything","v":{"O":2,"A":-1}},{"t":"Get things done","v":{"C":2}},{"t":"Care how everyone feels","v":{"A":2}},{"t":"Bring the energy","v":{"E":2}}]},{"id":"rfo10","sys":"four","text":"Arguing about an idea for fun is…","options":[{"t":"The best thing ever","v":{"A":-2,"O":1}},{"t":"Fun with the right people","v":{"A":-1}},{"t":"Kind of stressful","v":{"A":1}},{"t":"Pointless, just agree","v":{"A":2}}]},{"id":"ren1","sys":"ennea","text":"What would hurt most to hear?","options":[{"t":"You got it wrong","v":{"e1":2}},{"t":"You only think about yourself","v":{"e2":2}},{"t":"You're average","v":{"e3":2,"e4":1}},{"t":"You don't know what you're talking about","v":{"e5":2}}]},{"id":"ren2","sys":"ennea","text":"What would you most hate to lose?","options":[{"t":"My safety net and people I trust","v":{"e6":2}},{"t":"My freedom to do fun stuff","v":{"e7":2}},{"t":"My control over my own life","v":{"e8":2}},{"t":"My peace and quiet","v":{"e9":2}}]},{"id":"ren3","sys":"ennea","text":"At your best, you are…","options":[{"t":"Fair and principled","v":{"e1":2}},{"t":"Generous and caring","v":{"e2":2}},{"t":"Driven and impressive","v":{"e3":2}},{"t":"Original and honest about feelings","v":{"e4":2}}]},{"id":"ren4","sys":"ennea","text":"At your best, you are also…","options":[{"t":"Wise and clear-headed","v":{"e5":2}},{"t":"Loyal and prepared","v":{"e6":2}},{"t":"Joyful and spontaneous","v":{"e7":2}},{"t":"Strong and protective","v":{"e8":2}}]},{"id":"ren5","sys":"ennea","text":"When there's tension in a room, you…","options":[{"t":"Smooth it over so everyone calms down","v":{"e9":2}},{"t":"Confront it head on","v":{"e8":2}},{"t":"Crack a joke to lighten it","v":{"e7":2}},{"t":"Watch and figure out what's really going on","v":{"e5":2,"e6":1}}]},{"id":"ren6","sys":"ennea","text":"Your inner voice mostly says…","options":[{"t":"Do it right","v":{"e1":2}},{"t":"Be needed","v":{"e2":2}},{"t":"Be the best","v":{"e3":2}},{"t":"Be yourself, be different","v":{"e4":2}}]},{"id":"ren7","sys":"ennea","text":"When things go badly, you're most likely to…","options":[{"t":"Pull back and think it through alone","v":{"e5":2}},{"t":"Worry about what's next","v":{"e6":2}},{"t":"Find something fun to do instead","v":{"e7":2}},{"t":"Go along and avoid making waves","v":{"e9":2}}]},{"id":"ren8","sys":"ennea","text":"You feel proudest when…","options":[{"t":"You fixed something that was wrong","v":{"e1":2,"e8":1}},{"t":"Someone thanks you for helping","v":{"e2":2}},{"t":"You won or got recognized","v":{"e3":2}},{"t":"You made something nobody else could","v":{"e4":2}}]},{"id":"ren9","sys":"ennea","text":"In a friend group you're known as…","options":[{"t":"The one who knows random facts","v":{"e5":2}},{"t":"The ride-or-die","v":{"e6":2}},{"t":"The fun one","v":{"e7":2}},{"t":"The chill one","v":{"e9":2}}]},{"id":"rte1","sys":"temper","text":"At a loud party you…","options":[{"t":"Feed off the energy","v":{"E":2,"N":-1}},{"t":"Get hyped then crash","v":{"E":1,"N":1}},{"t":"Get overwhelmed fast","v":{"E":-1,"N":2}},{"t":"Find a quiet corner, no stress","v":{"E":-2,"N":-1}}]},{"id":"rte2","sys":"temper","text":"Bad news hits you…","options":[{"t":"Hard, and it sticks around","v":{"N":2}},{"t":"Hard, but I bounce back","v":{"N":1,"E":1}},{"t":"Not that much","v":{"N":-2}},{"t":"I go quiet and process it","v":{"E":-1,"N":1}}]},{"id":"rte3","sys":"temper","text":"Your friends would describe your mood as…","options":[{"t":"Sunny","v":{"E":2,"N":-2}},{"t":"Intense","v":{"E":1,"N":2}},{"t":"Deep","v":{"E":-1,"N":1}},{"t":"Unbothered","v":{"E":-1,"N":-2}}]},{"id":"rte4","sys":"temper","text":"When you're excited about something, you…","options":[{"t":"Tell everyone immediately","v":{"E":2}},{"t":"Tell one person","v":{"E":-1}},{"t":"Keep it to yourself","v":{"E":-2}},{"t":"Jump in and start doing it","v":{"E":1}}]},{"id":"rte5","sys":"temper","text":"Waiting for test results, you feel…","options":[{"t":"Pretty relaxed","v":{"N":-2}},{"t":"A little nervous","v":{"N":0}},{"t":"Can't stop thinking about it","v":{"N":2}},{"t":"Annoyed it's taking so long","v":{"N":1,"E":1}}]},{"id":"rte6","sys":"temper","text":"Your ideal weekend pace is…","options":[{"t":"Packed, nonstop","v":{"E":2}},{"t":"Busy but with breaks","v":{"E":1}},{"t":"Slow and easy","v":{"E":-1,"N":-1}},{"t":"Mostly at home recharging","v":{"E":-2}}]},{"id":"rar1","sys":"arche","text":"Pick a quest.","options":[{"t":"Defeat the villain","v":{"ar_hero":2}},{"t":"Find the hidden truth","v":{"ar_sage":2}},{"t":"Map the unknown land","v":{"ar_explorer":2}},{"t":"Build the city everyone dreams about","v":{"ar_creator":2,"ar_ruler":1}}]},{"id":"rar2","sys":"arche","text":"Your role in the movie would be…","options":[{"t":"The one who breaks all the rules","v":{"ar_rebel":2}},{"t":"The one who keeps everyone alive","v":{"ar_caregiver":2}},{"t":"The comic relief","v":{"ar_jester":2}},{"t":"The one who falls in love","v":{"ar_lover":2}}]},{"id":"rar3","sys":"arche","text":"The superpower that fits you:","options":[{"t":"Bending reality","v":{"ar_magician":2}},{"t":"Seeing the good in everyone","v":{"ar_innocent":2}},{"t":"Commanding an army","v":{"ar_ruler":2}},{"t":"Blending in anywhere","v":{"ar_everyperson":2}}]},{"id":"rar4","sys":"arche","text":"You'd want people to remember you as…","options":[{"t":"Brave","v":{"ar_hero":2}},{"t":"Wise","v":{"ar_sage":2}},{"t":"Kind","v":{"ar_caregiver":2}},{"t":"Unforgettable fun","v":{"ar_jester":2}}]},{"id":"rar5","sys":"arche","text":"What pulls you in most?","options":[{"t":"Freedom","v":{"ar_explorer":2,"ar_rebel":1}},{"t":"Beauty and closeness","v":{"ar_lover":2}},{"t":"Making something new","v":{"ar_creator":2}},{"t":"Changing how things work","v":{"ar_magician":2,"ar_rebel":1}}]},{"id":"rar6","sys":"arche","text":"Your worst nightmare:","options":[{"t":"Being powerless","v":{"ar_hero":1,"ar_ruler":2}},{"t":"Being fooled","v":{"ar_sage":2}},{"t":"Being left out","v":{"ar_everyperson":2,"ar_lover":1}},{"t":"Being punished for nothing","v":{"ar_innocent":2}}]},{"id":"rar7","sys":"arche","text":"In a group, you'd most want to be…","options":[{"t":"The leader","v":{"ar_ruler":2,"ar_hero":1}},{"t":"The rebel","v":{"ar_rebel":2}},{"t":"The heart of it","v":{"ar_caregiver":1,"ar_lover":1,"ar_everyperson":1}},{"t":"The visionary","v":{"ar_magician":2,"ar_creator":1}}]},{"id":"rar8","sys":"arche","text":"Pick a vibe:","options":[{"t":"Simple and good","v":{"ar_innocent":2}},{"t":"Wild and new","v":{"ar_explorer":2}},{"t":"Clever and playful","v":{"ar_jester":2}},{"t":"Quiet and thoughtful","v":{"ar_sage":2}}]},{"id":"rdi1","sys":"disc","text":"On a team project, you're the one who…","options":[{"t":"Takes charge and sets the deadline","v":{"ds_D":2}},{"t":"Keeps everyone motivated","v":{"ds_I":2}},{"t":"Makes sure no one's left behind","v":{"ds_S":2}},{"t":"Checks every detail","v":{"ds_C":2}}]},{"id":"rdi2","sys":"disc","text":"Your texting style is…","options":[{"t":"Short and to the point","v":{"ds_D":2}},{"t":"Lots of emojis and energy","v":{"ds_I":2}},{"t":"Friendly and steady","v":{"ds_S":2}},{"t":"Correct spelling, full sentences","v":{"ds_C":2}}]},{"id":"rdi3","sys":"disc","text":"What 